	(text "I had some vertical through-hole USB-C receptacles:\n  LCSC C168704 (Jing 918-418K2022Y40000)\n\nThese models from DigiKey are compatible:\n  SameSky UJ20-C-V-C-3-SMT-TR\n  Linkplex LUB-C131-0-007-G-19\n\nOther vertical choices considered:\n  JAE DX07S024WJ3R400 (good but expensive)\n  GCT USB4115-03-C (very common but hard to solder)\n  GCT USB4145-03-0230-C (easier to solder)\n\nI went with GCT USB4145 because it seems to be\nhand-solderable while also making routing easier\nwith SMT pads instead of through-hole.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 91.44 229.362 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d5ae8e4f-e326-490d-9ae3-7a7a39a72fbf")
	)
	(text "Pull ~{RST} high to enable\nchip by default.\n\n~{SEN} selects I2C address:\nlow:  0x11 (17)\nhigh: 0x63 (99)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 47.244 47.752 0)
		(effects
